        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They lost contact.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You were sent alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 hours after the last transmission from Research Site E-17, you are sent to investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone. Unarmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The facility is silent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind a sealed door something still lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragments, and the slow unraveling of what should have stayed buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Were Sent Alone is a narrative-driven psychological horror game focused on atmosphere, isolation, and the fear of knowing too much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration in a cold, deserted underground research site</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative fragments told through logs, audio, and environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsettling atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on what you discover-and what you choose to do</p></li></ul>",
